title: The Crisis of the Republic
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: subversion_progress >= 9.9 and subversion_done != 1
priority: 870
max-visits: 1

= The Crisis of the Republic

The movement to subvert the democratic order has reached a critical mass: officials loyal to a leader rather than to the Constitution have been installed, courts are being defied, and elections are being undermined.

Everything we have built (or failed to build) will now be tested.

- @crisis_all_in: Mobilize every resource at our disposal
- @crisis_negotiate: Seek a political settlement

@crisis_all_in
choose-if: resources >= 0
on-arrival: {!
Q.subversion_done = 1;
var score = SD.resilience(Q) + 5;
Q.dispute_score = Math.round(score);
Q.dispute_ok = score >= 80 ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.dispute_ok) { Q.subversion_progress = 3; Q.institutions += 5; Q.maga_strength -= 6; Q.pro_democracy += 4; }
else { Q.game_lost = 1; Q.institutions = 8; }
!}

[? if dispute_ok = 1 : The republic holds. Civil society, courts, and a handful of principled officials hold the line. ?][? if dispute_ok = 0 : The republic falters. The guardrails fail. ?]

@crisis_negotiate
on-arrival: {!
Q.subversion_done = 1;
var score = SD.resilience(Q) + Q.gopmod_relation * 0.08;
Q.dispute_score = Math.round(score);
Q.dispute_ok = score >= 80 ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.dispute_ok) { Q.subversion_progress = 4; Q.institutions += 3; Q.gopmod_relation += 5; }
else { Q.game_lost = 1; Q.institutions = 8; }
!}

[? if dispute_ok = 1 : A fragile settlement is reached. The danger recedes, for now. ?][? if dispute_ok = 0 : The settlement is a surrender. ?]
